  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"98\">🚗 Xbox 360 Game – Grand Theft Auto V (GTA 5) | €9,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"376\"><strong data-start=\"100\" data-end=\"141\">Grand Theft Auto V</strong> is één van de meest populaire open-wereld games ooit. Beleef een uitgebreid verhaal, wissel tussen drie personages en ontdek de enorme wereld van Los Santos. Deze versie voor de <strong data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"332\">Xbox 360</strong> is volledig getest en <strong data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"375\">direct speelbaar</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"378\" data-end=\"395\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"577\">\r\n<li data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"422\">\r\n<p data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"422\"><strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"411\">Platform:</strong> Xbox 360</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"423\" data-end=\"463\">\r\n<p data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"463\"><strong data-start=\"425\" data-end=\"434\">Game:</strong> Grand Theft Auto V (GTA 5)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"464\" data-end=\"498\">\r\n<p data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"498\"><strong data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"476\">Genre:</strong> Actie / Open wereld</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"544\">\r\n<p data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"544\"><strong data-start=\"501\" data-end=\"515\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer & Multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"545\" data-end=\"577\">\r\n<p data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"577\"><strong data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"560\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"592\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<li data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"595\" data-end=\"642\">Grote open wereld met eindeloze mogelijkheden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"695\">\r\n<p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"695\">Sterke verhaallijn met drie speelbare personages</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"738\">\r\n<p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"738\">Veel actie, missies en zijactiviteiten</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"769\">\r\n<p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"769\">Populaire GTA Online modus</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"797\">\r\n<p data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"797\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"799\" data-end=\"808\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"819\"><strong data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"819\">€ 9,99</strong></p>",
